      "works_on": ["ingredient/onion"],
      "with": ["ingredient/olive-oil", "ingredient/salt"],
      "text": "Fry the onions in the olive oil in batches, in a wide pan, until they are a deep brown and crisp at the edges. Lift them onto a rack and salt them lightly. Keep the oil.",
